<!DOCTYPE html><html class="bg-primary-foreground text-foreground" lang="en"><head><meta charSet="utf-8" data-next-head=""/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" data-next-head=""/><title data-next-head="">Browserless Pricing: Simple, Usage-Based Plans</title><meta name="description" content="Start free with 1,000 units, free CAPTCHA solving, and access to every API endpoint. Transparent, usage-based pricing that scales as you grow." data-next-head=""/><meta name="robots" content="index, follow" data-next-head=""/><meta property="og:title" content="Browserless Pricing: Simple, Usage-Based Plans" data-next-head=""/><meta property="og:description" content="Start free with 1,000 units, free CAPTCHA solving, and access to every API endpoint. Transparent, usage-based pricing that scales as you grow." data-next-head=""/><meta property="og:image" content="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/65cb4923a3a6b08fe1124094/6601a7a5b8508b353addd84f_social-preview.jpg" data-next-head=""/><meta property="og:type" content="website" data-next-head=""/><meta property="og:locale" content="en_US" data-next-head=""/><meta property="og:url" content="https://www.browserless.io/pricing" data-next-head=""/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" data-next-head=""/><meta name="twitter:title" content="Browserless Pricing: Simple, Usage-Based Plans" data-next-head=""/><meta name="twitter:description" content="Start free with 1,000 units, free CAPTCHA solving, and access to every API endpoint. Transparent, usage-based pricing that scales as you grow." data-next-head=""/><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/65cb4923a3a6b08fe1124094/6601a7a5b8508b353addd84f_social-preview.jpg" data-next-head=""/><meta name="twitter:site" content="@browserless" data-next-head=""/><link rel="canonical" href="https://www.browserless.io/pricing" data-next-head=""/><link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/65cb4923a3a6b08fe1124094/6890bf5c78666f8d84f1a584_favicon%20(1).svg" data-next-head=""/><meta name="google-site-verification" content="7z1GX1wvG0mgdK3G9ndTUyICOg9jc0rVfjXDuTAEApU"/><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml"/><link rel="dns-prefetch" href="https://api.github.com"/><link rel="dns-prefetch" href="https://api.reo.dev"/><link rel="dns-prefetch" href="https://sweet-heart-af5f.zach-7be.workers.dev"/><link rel="dns-prefetch" href="https://static.reo.dev"/><link rel="dns-prefetch" href="https://js.hs-scripts.com"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/media/22a5144ee8d83bca-s.p.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin="anonymous" data-next-font="size-adjust"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/media/ee8d328edfa74ac8-s.p.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin="anonymous" data-next-font="size-adjust"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/css/02052be6f038af72.css" as="style"/><script type="application/ld+json" data-next-head="">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.browserless.io/pricing#webpage","url":"https://www.browserless.io/pricing","name":"Browserless Pricing: Simple, Usage-Based Plans","description":"Start free with 1,000 units, free CAPTCHA solving, and access to every API endpoint. Transparent, usage-based pricing that scales as you grow.","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://www.browserless.io#website"},"breadcrumb":{"@id":"https://www.browserless.io/pricing#breadcrumb"}},{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://www.browserless.io#website","url":"https://www.browserless.io","name":"Browserless","publisher":{"@id":"https://www.browserless.io#organization"}},{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://www.browserless.io#organization","name":"Browserless","url":"https://www.browserless.io","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://www.browserless.io/browserless_logo.webp"},"sameAs":["https://github.com/browserless","https://x.com/browserless","https://www.linkedin.com/company/browserless-io","https://hub.docker.com/r/browserless/chrome"]},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","@id":"https://www.browserless.io/pricing#breadcrumb","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://www.browserless.io"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Browserless Pricing: Simple, Usage-Based Plans","item":"https://www.browserless.io/pricing"}]}]}</script><script type="application/ld+json" data-next-head="">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"I still have questions, can I talk to someone?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Absolutely! If you still have open questions, feel free to reach out via our contact page or email us at support@browserless.io and we will be happy to answer any questions for you."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do unit-based plans work?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Unit-based plans allow users to subscribe to a plan that covers the number of Units they intend to use in a month."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What constitutes a Unit?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A Unit is any time a browser is started with our API/library and is used for up to 30 seconds. A new Unit is charged every 30 seconds of a running Session."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What happens if I go over my unit-based plan?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"If you happen to go over your subscription amount, then overage fees are charged per Unit at the specified overage rate for any paid plans. Free plans will actively reject incoming requests after the threshold is met. Any overage fees are billed whenever overages reach the dollar amount of the subscription the customer is on, when changing plans, or at the end of the month if the billing threshold is not reached. For billing clarity, your invoice will have separate line items for the subscription and any overages. We will send you an email notice anytime you start accumulating overage charges, which happens at most once an hour. To cap overage spend on a paid plan, set an overage spend limit on the Billing page of your account dashboard."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I change plans whenever I’d like to?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes! Once you change plans we reset your billing cycle to the time of the change and charge for the full amount of the plan you’re moving to."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What are the Self-Hosted options?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Self-hosting Browserless is a license to host the service in your own cloud or on-prem. The Open-Source and Private docker versions of Browserless are both available as self-hosted options. This can be a great option for data-sensitive organizations needing to comply with local laws and other standards. See the Enterprise deployment guide on our blog for the full Docker and Kubernetes setup."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Are there annual discounts available?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Every paid plan can be billed monthly or annually. Annual billing saves 30% and includes additional concurrency on the Prototyping, Starter, and Scale plans. For custom terms on larger commitments, contact us via our contact page or at sales@browserless.io."}}]}</script><script>window.dataLayer=window.dataLayer||[];function gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments);}gtag('consent','default',{'ad_storage':'denied','ad_user_data':'denied','ad_personalization':'denied','analytics_storage':'denied','functionality_storage':'denied','personalization_storage':'denied','security_storage':'granted'});</script><script>
                
