 class="text-sm leading-relaxed">Extendable codebase</span></div><div class="flex items-start"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mr-3 mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-sm leading-relaxed">Commercial license for self-hosting</span></div><div class="flex items-start"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mr-3 mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-sm leading-relaxed">Video support and setup assistance</span></div><div class="flex items-start"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mr-3 mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-sm leading-relaxed">Dedicated technical account manager</span></div><div class="flex items-start"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mr-3 mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-sm leading-relaxed">SSO</span></div><div class="flex items-start"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mr-3 mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-sm leading-relaxed">Extensive datacenter locations including EU</span></div><div class="flex items-start"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mr-3 mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-sm leading-relaxed">Keep browsers warm for reconnecting</span></div><div class="flex items-start"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mr-3 mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-sm leading-relaxed">Manage downloaded files</span></div><div class="flex items-start"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mr-3 mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-sm leading-relaxed">Private Slack support</span></div><div class="flex items-start"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mr-3 mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-sm leading-relaxed">User roles</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="border-t border-border/30 py-14 md:py-16"><div class="container mx-auto px-4"><div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-6" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><p class="brand-eyebrow text-center text-brand-label uppercase text-muted-foreground md:text-brand-label-lg">Security &amp; compliance</p><a class="group flex flex-col items-center gap-4 rounded-xl focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-4" aria-label="See Browserless security and compliance details" href="/trust#compliance"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-full border border-border/60 bg-card px-4 py-2.5 shadow-sm transition-all group-hover:border-primary/40 group-hover:shadow-md"><span class="flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-primary/10"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield-check h-3.5 w-3.5 text-primary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg></span><span class="text-sm font-semibold text-foreground">SOC 2</span><span class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">Type II</span></span><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-full border border-border/60 bg-card px-4 py-2.5 shadow-sm transition-all group-hover:border-primary/40 group-hover:shadow-md"><span class="flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-primary/10"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-globe h-3.5 w-3.5 text-primary" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20"></path><path d="M2 12h20"></path></svg></span><span class="text-sm font-semibold text-foreground">GDPR</span><span class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">Compliant</span></span><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-full border border-border/60 bg-card px-4 py-2.5 shadow-sm transition-all group-hover:border-primary/40 group-hover:shadow-md"><span class="flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-primary/10"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-heart-pulse h-3.5 w-3.5 text-primary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 9.5a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 9.591-3.676.56.56 0 0 0 .818 0A5.49 5.49 0 0 1 22 9.5c0 2.29-1.5 4-3 5.5l-5.492 5.313a2 2 0 0 1-3 .019L5 15c-1.5-1.5-3-3.2-3-5.5"></path><path d="M3.22 13H9.5l.5-1 2 4.5 2-7 1.5 3.5h5.27"></path></svg></span><span class="text-sm font-semibold text-foreground">HIPAA</span><span class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">BAA Available</span></span><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-full border border-border/60 bg-card px-4 py-2.5 shadow-sm transition-all group-hover:border-primary/40 group-hover:shadow-md"><span class="flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-primary/10"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-file-check h-3.5 w-3.5 text-primary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z"></path><path d="M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5"></path><path d="m9 15 2 2 4-4"></path></svg></span><span class="text-sm font-semibold text-foreground">DPA</span><span class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">Available</span></span></div><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground transition-colors group-hover:text-foreground">See the Trust Center<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-3 w-3 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span></a></div></div></section><section class="dark not-prose relative overflow-hidden bg-background text-foreground"><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center" style="background-image:url(&quot;https://www.browserless.io/brand/motifs/05.webp&quot;)"></div><div class="relative flex flex-col items-start gap-6 md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between container mx-auto px-4 py-12 lg:py-16"><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="brand-eyebrow mb-3 text-brand-label md:text-brand-label-lg uppercase text-cyber-lime-500">Enterprise guide</p><h2 class="mb-3 font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] text-foreground text-3xl md:text-4xl">Self-host Browserless on your infrastructure</h2><p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Docker, Kubernetes, GPU acceleration, air-gapped licensing, and HIPAA-ready deployment, all in one guide.</p></div><a class="group relative inline-flex w-full shrink-0 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden whitespace-nowrap rounded-md bg-primary font-medium text-primary-foreground transition-all hover:scale-[1.02] sm:w-auto h-12 px-6 sm:px-10" href="/blog/self-host-browserless-enterprise-docker-deployment-guide"><span class="relative z-10 flex items-center">Read the deployment guide<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right ml-2 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5 h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span></a></div></section><section class="py-12"><div class="container mx-auto px-4 lg:px-20"><div class="" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><div class="rounded-xl border text-card-foreground shadow border-border/50 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/5 via-card to-card/80"><div class="p-6 px-8 py-12"><h3 class="mb-6 text-center text-2xl font-bold tracking-[-0.02em] text-foreground">What is a Unit?</h3><p class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">A “Unit” is a block of browser time of up to 30 seconds per browser connection. Longer-running automations use an extra Unit for every 30 seconds. Session-reconnects count as new browser connections and incur a fresh Unit charge.</p><div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-8 text-sm"><div class="flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/50 bg-card px-6 py-3"><span class="mr-2 text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">6 Units</span><span class="text-muted-foreground">per MB for Residential Proxy</span></div><div class="flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/50 bg-card px-6 py-3"><span class="mr-2 text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">2 Units</span><span class="text-muted-foreground">per MB for Datacenter Proxy</span></div><div class="flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/50 bg-card px-6 py-3"><span class="mr-2 text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">10 Units</span><span class="text-muted-foreground">per successful Captcha solve</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-12"><div class="container mx-auto px-4 lg:px-20"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center " style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><h2 class="mb-6 text-balance text-brand-h2 text-foreground md:text-brand-h2-lg">Frequently Asked Questions</h2><p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Have a question? We&#x27;ve got answers.</p></div><div class="mt-12" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><div class="w-full" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" class="border-b dark:border-secondary"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_R_6k96_" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between py-4 transition-all hover:underline [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 text-left text-base font-semibold" data-radix-collection-item="">I still have questions, can I talk to someone?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_16k96_" hidden="" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-_R_6k96_" data-orientation="vertical" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" class="border-b dark:border-secondary"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_R_ak96_" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between py-4 transition-all hover:underline [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 text-left text-base font-semibold" data-radix-collection-item="">How do unit-based plans work?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="curre