y"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_R_ik96_" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between py-4 transition-all hover:underline [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 text-left text-base font-semibold" data-radix-collection-item="">What happens if I go over my unit-based plan?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_1ik96_" hidden="" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-_R_ik96_" data-orientation="vertical" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" class="border-b dark:border-secondary"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_R_mk96_" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between py-4 transition-all hover:underline [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 text-left text-base font-semibold" data-radix-collection-item="">Can I change plans whenever I’d like to?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_1mk96_" hidden="" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-_R_mk96_" data-orientation="vertical" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" class="border-b dark:border-secondary"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_R_qk96_" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between py-4 transition-all hover:underline [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 text-left text-base font-semibold" data-radix-collection-item="">What are the Self-Hosted options?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_1qk96_" hidden="" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-_R_qk96_" data-orientation="vertical" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" class="border-b dark:border-secondary"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_R_uk96_" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between py-4 transition-all hover:underline [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 text-left text-base font-semibold" data-radix-collection-item="">Are there annual discounts available?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_1uk96_" hidden="" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-_R_uk96_" data-orientation="vertical" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-12"><div class="container mx-auto px-4 lg:px-20"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center " style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><h2 class="mb-6 text-balance text-brand-h2 text-foreground md:text-brand-h2-lg">Browser as a Service Highlights</h2><p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Everything you need to run browser automation at scale, without the headaches.</p></div><div class="mt-16 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3" style="opacity:0"><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><div class="rounded-xl border text-card-foreground shadow h-full border-border/50 bg-gradient-to-br from-card to-card/80 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-primary/30 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-primary/5"><div class="p-6"><h3 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold">No mysterious memory leaks</h3><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">We keep the browsers running smoothly, so you don’t need to figure out what’s eating up your resources.</p></div></div></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><div class="rounded-xl border text-card-foreground shadow h-full border-border/50 bg-gradient-to-br from-card to-card/80 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-primary/30 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-primary/5"><div class="p-6"><h3 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold">Scaling and load balancing</h3><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Handles scaling automatically to absorb traffic surges.</p></div></div></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><div class="rounded-xl border text-card-foreground shadow h-full border-border/50 bg-gradient-to-br from-card to-card/80 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-primary/30 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-primary/5"><div class="p-6"><h3 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold">PDF, screenshot and download APIs</h3><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">REST APIs for common tasks with custom styling.</p></div></div></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><div class="rounded-xl border text-card-foreground shadow h-full border-border/50 bg-gradient-to-br from-card to-card/80 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-primary/30 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-primary/5"><div class="p-6"><h3 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold">Keep browsers alive with session reconnects</h3><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Uses<!-- --> <a class="inline-flex items-center text-primary hover:underline" href="/feature/cookies-reconnects">reconnects</a> <!-- -->to maintain open processes.</p></div></div></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><div class="rounded-xl border text-card-foreground shadow h-full border-border/50 bg-gradient-to-br from-card to-card/80 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-primary/30 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-primary/5"><div class="p-6"><h3 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold">Custom machine setup</h3><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Enterprise users can specify GPUs, operating systems, and cloud providers.</p></div></div></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><div class="rounded-xl border text-card-foreground shadow h-full border-border/50 bg-gradient-to-br from-card to-card/80 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-primary/30 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-primary/5"><div class="p-6"><h3 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold">Supports Playwright and Puppeteer</h3><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Quick endpoint change enables connection with existing scripts.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="container mx-auto px-4 pb-16 pt-4 md:pb-24"><div class="dark relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-background px-6 py-20 text-foreground lg:py-28"><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center" style="background-image:url(&quot;https://www.browserless.io/brand/motifs/05.webp&quot;)"></div><div class="relative mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><h2 class="mb-8 text-balance text-brand-h2 text-foreground md:text-brand-h2-lg">Need something custom or help getting started?</h2><div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 sm:flex-row"><div tabindex="0"><a class="group relative inline-flex h-12 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-md bg-primary px-12 text-lg font-medium text-primary-foreground shadow-2xl shadow-primary/30 transition-shadow hover:shadow-primary/40" href="/contact"><span class="relative z-10 flex items-center">Contact Us<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right ml-2 h-5 w-5 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span></a></div></div></div></div></se